A||||8||Fformula88||Newly painted Yellow Fiero!!||||1||
Z||000000||Fformula88||11-29-2001||09:24 PM||||Wow, this car has come a long way!  Last February a Taurus wagon spun out in front of me on the highway and I nailed its broadside with this car!  It was my fathers 87 coupe.  With the ins money from the other company (he was 100% at fault!) he bought a new Fiero, an 85 SE 2m6.  My father gave the 87 with all new body panels to my uncle for my 16 yr old cousin to kick around in.  He had an extra gallon of yellow paint for his 79 Trans Am and decided to give it a shot on the Fiero.  I think it looks great, here are pics!  BTW, he thought the monotone would look good based on a red monotone Fiero he saw at Watkins Glen this summer, but has decided to make the mouldings black again.  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/yellowfiero1.JPG">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/yellowfiero2.JPG">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/YELLOWFIERO3.JPG">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/yellowfiero4.JPG">  <P>He's also going to re-polish the wheels (it was done about 7 years ago but they are awfully dull now!<P>Here is a couple of the new 2m6 too!<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/whitefiero2.JPG">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/whitefiero1.JPG">  <p>[This message has been edited by Fformula88 (edited 11-29-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||REDHOTT88||11-29-2001||09:45 PM||||Looks good Fformula88!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_brow.gif"><P>I'm not sure if I like the molding painted yellow though... BUT it still looks good!<P>I'm gonna keep my Formula red, I don't think I like "YELLOWHOTT88" as screen name! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Steve<BR><B>1988 Formula 2.8L</B> V6 5 speed<BR><FONT COLOR="ffoooo"> (Red & shiny all over - with all the options!)</FONT>||||reg||14
Z||000002||FieroMaster88||11-29-2001||09:50 PM||||Looks good.  I still like my red tho!  Looks like a nice car.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jamessig.jpg">                   <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>Not your ordinary 88 coupe!||||reg||1
Z||000003||FieroPerformance||11-29-2001||09:53 PM||||Had you two painted any other cars before this?<P>The reason I ask is because I am getting ready to try to paint my car and I have no previous experience. I am pretty good at spray painting though, and I have some artistic ability so I hope that's enough to make the car look good as long as I take my time and don't get lazy.<P>-Charlie<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsigfperformance.jpg"> ||||reg||1
